    " ",
    {
     "type": "verse",
     "marker": "v",
     "number": "1"
    },
    "A Psalm of David, when he fled from his son Absalom."
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "b"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "q1",
   "content": [
    "O LORD, how my foes have increased!"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "q2",
   "content": [
    "How many rise up against me!"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "q1",
   "content": [
    " ",
    {
     "type": "verse",
     "marker": "v",
     "number": "2"
    },
    "Many say of me,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "q2",
   "content": [
    "“God will not deliver him.”"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "qr",
   "content": [
    "Selah",
    {
     "type": "note",
     "marker": "f",
     "caller": "+",
     "content": [
