        "or "
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "char",
       "marker": "fqa",
       "content": [
        "Interlude "
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "char",
       "marker": "ft",
       "content": [
        "is probably a musical or literary term; here and throughout the Psalms."
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "q1",
   "content": [
    " ",
    {
     "type": "verse",
     "marker": "v",
     "number": "3"
    },
    "But You, O LORD, are a shield around me,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "q2",
   "content": [
    "my glory, and the One who lifts my head."
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "q1",
   "content": [
    " ",
    {
     "type": "verse",
     "marker": "v",
     "number": "4"
    },
    "To the LORD I cry aloud,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "q2",
   "content": [
    "and He answers me from His holy mountain."
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "qr",
   "content": [
    "Selah"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "q1",
   "content": [
    " ",
    {
     "type": "verse",
     "marker": "v",
     "number": "5"
    },
    "I lie down and sleep;"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "q2",
   "content": [
    "I wake again, for the LORD sustains me."
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "q1",
   "content": [
    " ",
    {
     "type": "verse",
     "marker": "v",
     "number": "6"
    },
    "I will not fear the myriads"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "q2",
   "content": [
    "set against me on every side."
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "b"
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "q1",
   "content": [
    " ",
    {
     "type": "verse",
     "marker": "v",
     "number": "7"
    },
    "Arise, O LORD!"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "q2",
   "content": [
    "Save me, O my God!"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "q1",
   "content": [
    "Strike all my enemies on the jaw;"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "q2",
   "content": [
    "break the teeth of the wicked."
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "q1",
   "content": [
    " ",
    {
     "type": "verse",
     "marker": "v",
     "number": "8"
    },
    "Salvation belongs to the LORD;"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "q2",
   "content": [
    "may Your blessing be on Your people."
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "marker": "qr",
   "content": [
    "Selah"
   ]
  }
 ]
